{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大衛的後裔做王"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶西的樹樁上必生發新枝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他根莖長出的枝子必結果子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的靈必住在祂身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使祂有聰明和智慧、謀略和能力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"能認識並敬畏耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必以敬畏耶和華為樂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂不憑眼見施行審判，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不憑耳聞斷定是非，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是按公義審判貧窮人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公正為受苦者斷案。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必用口中的杖擊打世界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以嘴裡的氣殺戮惡人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公義必作祂的腰帶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"信實必作祂肋下的帶子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"那時，豺狼和綿羊羔同住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豹子和山羊羔同臥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛犢和獅子同群，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小孩子必引領牠們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛與熊一起進食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小牛和小熊一起躺臥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"獅子像牛一樣吃草。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃奶的嬰孩必在毒蛇的洞口玩耍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斷奶的孩子必把手伸進蛇洞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我的整個聖山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們都不傷人、不害物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為大地必充滿對耶和華的認識，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同海洋被水充滿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["到那日，耶西的根必成為引導萬民的旗幟，列邦都來尋求祂，祂的安歇之處充滿榮耀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["到那日，主必再次伸手從亞述、埃及、巴特羅、古實、以攔、示拿、哈馬和眾海島救回祂剩餘的子民。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"祂必向各國豎立旗幟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召集被擄的以色列人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把分散在世界各地的猶大人聚集起來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮必不再嫉妒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大的仇敵必被剷除，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮必不嫉妒猶大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大必不與以法蓮為敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必向西突襲非利士。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必一起擄掠東方人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"征服以東和摩押，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞捫人必順從他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必使埃及的海灣乾涸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必揮手使焦熱的風吹在幼發拉底河上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把河分成七條溪流，使人可以涉水而過。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有一條大道讓祂剩餘的子民從亞述歸回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像昔日以色列人離開埃及一樣。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}